:''Not to be confused with [[God (Special Cat)]].''
'''King's Mimic''' (わんわん大王の化身, ''Wan Wan Daiō no Keshin'', '''Incarnation of [[King Doge|Great King Wan Wan]]''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Anniversary/11th Year#Part 5: Battle at Doge Castle|Part 5: Battle at Doge Castle]]. He was added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = King's Mimic
|image = E 670.png
|first appearance = [[Anniversary/11th Year#Part 5: Battle at Doge Castle|Part 5: Battle at Doge Castle]]
|money drop = 1,111¢ - 4,388¢
}}

==Enemy==
Although this enemy tends to be very durable (especially when [[Cats Stand Together|buf]][[Super-Critical Hit!|fed]]) with 100% chance to freeze your units for 1.33 seconds, he ultimately doesn't prove to be too much of a threat due to having an exploitable trait, poor DPS and low freeze uptime.

==Strategy==
Try to take him down as quick as you possibly can with high-DPS units like [[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|Lasvoss]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] (but [[Wave Attack|Wave attackers]] might need to be used to clear the path for the latter), and Kotatsu, [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bodhisattva Cat]] & all Anti-Floating units work wonders against him.

